Third-party components:
========================================================================

1. VGA 8x16 Font (kernel/font_data.c)
   Source: Standard IBM VGA BIOS 8x16 font (public domain)
   Description: 256 glyphs × 16 bytes, the classic PC BIOS font
   License: Public Domain
   Note: Auto-generated by tools/gen_font.py

2. Build Tools (not linked into the product):
   - gcc 14.2.0          — GPL-3.0+ with GCC Runtime Exception (compatible)
   - nasm 2.16.03        — BSD-2-Clause (compatible)
   - xorriso 1.5.6       — GPL-3.0+ (build tool only)
   - grub 2.12            — GPL-3.0+ (build tool only, generates boot images)
   - qemu 10.0.13        — GPL-2.0+ (test tool only)

3. Bootloader (grub.cfg):
   ISO boot images generated by grub-mkrescue (BIOS + UEFI).
   GRUB is GPL-3.0+; the generated boot images are separate works
   per the GRUB license exception for boot images.

